# Repo-root build context excludes (all services build with context `..`). Keeps the
# context small + fast: these are either rebuilt in-image (node_modules via pnpm install,
# the uv venv via uv sync, dist via the app build) or irrelevant to any build.
# NB: do NOT exclude pnpm-lock.yaml / uv.lock / src/generated — builds need them.
.git
**/node_modules
**/.venv
.venv
**/dist
**/.output
**/.nitro
**/.tanstack
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.DS_Store
# codex's gitignored corpus/search data (~1.5 GB) and the artifacts/ bind-mount
# staging dir — never needed in any build context (D29-54, 0029 P5 S1).
apps/codex/data
artifacts
